<title>JAPAN: Minolta -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Minolta -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		117.53		vs	   98.47</p>
<p> Operating	    4.64		vs	  462    million</p>
<p> Current		3.65		vs	    1.04</p>
<p> Net		    2.94		vs	  801    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.52 yen	  vs	    2.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    279 million	  vs	 279 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Minolta Co Ltd is a maker of camera and plain paper copiers.</p>
</text>
